{"id":33518,"date":"2026-03-20T15:07:14","date_gmt":"2026-03-20T11:07:14","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.breedj.com\/?p=33518"},"modified":"2026-04-27T09:15:13","modified_gmt":"2026-04-27T05:15:13","slug":"benchmark-des-salaires-au-kenya","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/www.breedj.com\/fr\/benchmark-des-salaires-au-kenya\/","title":{"rendered":"Benchmark des salaires au Kenya"},"content":{"rendered":"\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-post\" data-elementor-id=\"33518\" class=\"elementor elementor-33518\" data-elementor-post-type=\"post\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-af62423 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"af62423\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-9aad164\" data-id=\"9aad164\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2c99cb2 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"2c99cb2\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p data-start=\"107\" data-end=\"451\">Dans un contexte de transformation du travail et d\u2019ouverture des entreprises \u00e0 des mod\u00e8les plus flexibles, comprendre les niveaux de r\u00e9mun\u00e9ration \u00e0 l\u2019international est devenu essentiel. Le benchmark des salaires au Kenya permet d\u2019\u00e9valuer pr\u00e9cis\u00e9ment les co\u00fbts, d\u2019identifier les opportunit\u00e9s et de structurer des \u00e9quipes \u00e0 distance performantes.<\/p><p data-start=\"453\" data-end=\"766\">Le Kenya s\u2019impose aujourd\u2019hui comme un hub strat\u00e9gique pour les fonctions digitales, les services externalis\u00e9s et les m\u00e9tiers du support. Gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 une population qualifi\u00e9e, anglophone et tourn\u00e9e vers le num\u00e9rique, le pays attire de plus en plus d\u2019entreprises \u00e0 la recherche de talents comp\u00e9tents \u00e0 co\u00fbts ma\u00eetris\u00e9s.<\/p><p data-start=\"768\" data-end=\"935\">Ce guide vous aide \u00e0 mieux comprendre le march\u00e9, les niveaux de r\u00e9mun\u00e9ration, les avantages op\u00e9rationnels, ainsi que les solutions pour collaborer en toute conformit\u00e9.<\/p><h2 data-section-id=\"sxf3xf\" data-start=\"942\" data-end=\"985\">Comprendre le march\u00e9 du travail au Kenya<\/h2><p data-start=\"987\" data-end=\"1205\">Le Kenya est l\u2019une des \u00e9conomies les plus dynamiques d\u2019Afrique de l\u2019Est. Sa capitale, Nairobi, est souvent consid\u00e9r\u00e9e comme un centre d\u2019innovation technologique, attirant startups, multinationales et talents qualifi\u00e9s.<\/p><p data-start=\"1207\" data-end=\"1248\">Le march\u00e9 du travail se caract\u00e9rise par :<\/p><ul data-start=\"1250\" data-end=\"1447\"><li data-section-id=\"1ljnle2\" data-start=\"1250\" data-end=\"1293\"><p data-start=\"1252\" data-end=\"1293\">Une forte croissance du secteur digital<\/p><\/li><li data-section-id=\"12tx2px\" data-start=\"1294\" data-end=\"1332\"><p data-start=\"1296\" data-end=\"1332\">Une jeunesse dipl\u00f4m\u00e9e et connect\u00e9e<\/p><\/li><li data-section-id=\"4lahev\" data-start=\"1333\" data-end=\"1373\"><p data-start=\"1335\" data-end=\"1373\">Une excellente ma\u00eetrise de l\u2019anglais<\/p><\/li><li data-section-id=\"16xwzpn\" data-start=\"1374\" data-end=\"1447\"><p data-start=\"1376\" data-end=\"1447\">Une culture professionnelle align\u00e9e avec les standards internationaux<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p data-start=\"1449\" data-end=\"1491\">Les profils les plus recherch\u00e9s incluent :<\/p><ul data-start=\"1493\" data-end=\"1647\"><li data-section-id=\"xcvvnc\" data-start=\"1493\" data-end=\"1526\"><p data-start=\"1495\" data-end=\"1526\">D\u00e9veloppeurs web et logiciels<\/p><\/li><li data-section-id=\"12fahf9\" data-start=\"1527\" data-end=\"1555\"><p data-start=\"1529\" data-end=\"1555\">Agents de support client<\/p><\/li><li data-section-id=\"xzf9s3\" data-start=\"1556\" data-end=\"1590\"><p data-start=\"1558\" data-end=\"1590\">Sp\u00e9cialistes marketing digital<\/p><\/li><li data-section-id=\"1tmyivj\" data-start=\"1591\" data-end=\"1629\"><p data-start=\"1593\" data-end=\"1629\">Comptables et analystes financiers<\/p><\/li><li data-section-id=\"rindlj\" data-start=\"1630\" data-end=\"1647\"><p data-start=\"1632\" data-end=\"1647\">Data analysts<\/p><\/li><\/ul><div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\"><h2 data-section-id=\"a4uf9r\" data-start=\"288\" data-end=\"320\">Salaires \u2013 Support client<\/h2><div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\"><div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\"><table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"322\" data-end=\"882\"><thead data-start=\"322\" data-end=\"392\"><tr data-start=\"322\" data-end=\"392\"><th class=\"\" data-start=\"322\" data-end=\"331\" data-col-size=\"md\">Niveau<\/th><th class=\"\" data-start=\"331\" data-end=\"344\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Exp\u00e9rience<\/th><th class=\"\" data-start=\"344\" data-end=\"368\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Salaire mensuel (EURO)<\/th><th class=\"\" data-start=\"368\" data-end=\"392\" data-col-size=\"md\">Missions principales<\/th><\/tr><\/thead><tbody data-start=\"462\" data-end=\"882\"><tr data-start=\"462\" data-end=\"547\"><td data-start=\"462\" data-end=\"473\" data-col-size=\"md\">D\u00e9butant<\/td><td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"473\" data-end=\"483\">0\u20132 ans<\/td><td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"483\" data-end=\"499\">350 \u2013 480 EURO<\/td><td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"499\" data-end=\"547\">Gestion des e-mails, tickets simples, appels<\/td><\/tr><tr data-start=\"548\" data-end=\"642\"><td data-start=\"548\" data-end=\"562\" data-col-size=\"md\">Exp\u00e9riment\u00e9<\/td><td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"562\" data-end=\"572\">2\u20135 ans<\/td><td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"572\" data-end=\"588\">480 \u2013 620 EURO<\/td><td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"588\" data-end=\"642\">Support multicanal, comptes clients internationaux<\/td><\/tr><tr data-start=\"643\" data-end=\"744\"><td data-start=\"643\" data-end=\"666\" data-col-size=\"md\">Senior \/ Team Leader<\/td><td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"666\" data-end=\"675\">5+ ans<\/td><td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"675\" data-end=\"691\">620 \u2013 900 EURO<\/td><td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"691\" data-end=\"744\">Supervision, gestion de litiges, customer success<\/td><\/tr><tr data-start=\"745\" data-end=\"882\"><td data-start=\"745\" data-end=\"800\" data-col-size=\"md\">Profil sp\u00e9cialis\u00e9 bilingue \/ horaires internationaux<\/td><td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"800\" data-end=\"811\">Variable<\/td><td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"811\" data-end=\"830\">900 \u2013 1 300+ EURO<\/td><td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"830\" data-end=\"882\">Support technique avanc\u00e9, projets internationaux<\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><\/div><\/div><\/div>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4057ed8 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"4057ed8\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3>\u00a0<\/h3><h3 style=\"text-align: center;\">Le benchmark salarial au Kenya r\u00e9v\u00e8le un <br \/>fort potentiel d\u2019optimisation des co\u00fbts.<\/h3><p>\u00a0<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c16ba3d elementor-align-center elementor-widget elementor-widget-button\" data-id=\"c16ba3d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"button.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-button-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"elementor-button elementor-button-link elementor-size-md\" href=\"https:\/\/www.breedj.com\/fr\/rejoignez-nous\/\" target=\"_blank\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-content-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-text\">Devenez membre Breedj<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/a>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1226fb4 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"1226fb4\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2 data-section-id=\"ryz213\" data-start=\"1654\" data-end=\"1730\">Pourquoi les entreprises s\u2019orientent vers des talents \u00e0 distance au Kenya<\/h2><p data-start=\"1732\" data-end=\"1856\">De plus en plus d\u2019entreprises choisissent de collaborer avec des talents bas\u00e9s au Kenya pour plusieurs raisons strat\u00e9giques.<\/p><h3 data-section-id=\"x6613g\" data-start=\"1858\" data-end=\"1898\">Acc\u00e8s \u00e0 des comp\u00e9tences qualifi\u00e9es<\/h3><p data-start=\"1899\" data-end=\"2014\">Le syst\u00e8me \u00e9ducatif k\u00e9nyan forme chaque ann\u00e9e des milliers de dipl\u00f4m\u00e9s dans les domaines techniques et commerciaux.<\/p><h3 data-section-id=\"sqwdfb\" data-start=\"2016\" data-end=\"2051\">Flexibilit\u00e9 organisationnelle<\/h3><p data-start=\"2052\" data-end=\"2165\">Les mod\u00e8les \u00e0 distance permettent de structurer des \u00e9quipes agiles, capables de s\u2019adapter rapidement aux besoins.<\/p><h3 data-section-id=\"ijcnqk\" data-start=\"2167\" data-end=\"2195\">Optimisation des co\u00fbts<\/h3><p data-start=\"2196\" data-end=\"2297\">Les niveaux de r\u00e9mun\u00e9ration restent comp\u00e9titifs par rapport aux march\u00e9s europ\u00e9ens ou nord-am\u00e9ricains.<\/p><h3 data-section-id=\"1cla073\" data-start=\"2299\" data-end=\"2345\">Compatibilit\u00e9 culturelle et linguistique<\/h3><p data-start=\"2346\" data-end=\"2441\">L\u2019anglais est largement ma\u00eetris\u00e9, facilitant la communication avec les \u00e9quipes internationales.<\/p><p data-start=\"2443\" data-end=\"2588\">\ud83d\udc49 Oui, il est aujourd\u2019hui relativement facile de travailler avec des talents bas\u00e9s au Kenya, \u00e0 condition d\u2019avoir un cadre structur\u00e9 et conforme.<\/p><p><a href=\"https:\/\/www.breedj.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/Salaire-Benchmark-Kenya-Report.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-large wp-image-33546\" src=\"https:\/\/www.breedj.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/Benchmark-des-salaires-au-Kenya-Breedj-1-1024x877.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"800\" height=\"685\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.breedj.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/Benchmark-des-salaires-au-Kenya-Breedj-1-1024x877.png 1024w, https:\/\/www.breedj.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/Benchmark-des-salaires-au-Kenya-Breedj-1-300x257.png 300w, https:\/\/www.breedj.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/Benchmark-des-salaires-au-Kenya-Breedj-1-768x658.png 768w, https:\/\/www.breedj.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/Benchmark-des-salaires-au-Kenya-Breedj-1.png 1200w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" \/><\/a><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-40a3590 elementor-align-center elementor-widget elementor-widget-button\" data-id=\"40a3590\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"button.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-button-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"elementor-button elementor-button-link elementor-size-md\" href=\"https:\/\/www.breedj.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/Salaire-Benchmark-Kenya-Report.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-content-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-text\">T\u00e9l\u00e9charger le pdf<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/a>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-fa629b8 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"fa629b8\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2 data-section-id=\"1x00e6b\" data-start=\"2595\" data-end=\"2640\">Comp\u00e9tences et forces des talents au Kenya<\/h2><p data-start=\"2642\" data-end=\"2704\">Les talents kenyans se distinguent par plusieurs atouts cl\u00e9s :<\/p><h3 data-section-id=\"nbe5kg\" data-start=\"2706\" data-end=\"2742\">Comp\u00e9tences techniques solides<\/h3><p data-start=\"2743\" data-end=\"2858\">Le pays dispose d\u2019un vivier important de profils IT, notamment dans le d\u00e9veloppement logiciel, la data et le cloud.<\/p><h3 data-section-id=\"dqolm2\" data-start=\"2860\" data-end=\"2891\">Adaptabilit\u00e9 et autonomie<\/h3><p data-start=\"2892\" data-end=\"3016\">Habitu\u00e9s \u00e0 travailler avec des entreprises internationales, ces professionnels sont souvent autonomes et orient\u00e9s r\u00e9sultats.<\/p><h3 data-section-id=\"1frveme\" data-start=\"3018\" data-end=\"3042\">Culture du service<\/h3><p data-start=\"3043\" data-end=\"3149\">Les m\u00e9tiers du support client et du back-office b\u00e9n\u00e9ficient d\u2019une forte culture de la satisfaction client.<\/p><h3 data-section-id=\"1mn6mj2\" data-start=\"3151\" data-end=\"3180\">Dynamisme et motivation<\/h3><p data-start=\"3181\" data-end=\"3281\">La volont\u00e9 d\u2019\u00e9voluer dans des environnements internationaux renforce l\u2019engagement et la performance.<\/p><p data-start=\"3283\" data-end=\"3403\">\ud83d\udc49 C\u2019est l\u2019une des raisons pour lesquelles les talents africains sont particuli\u00e8rement comp\u00e9titifs sur le march\u00e9 global.<\/p><div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\"><h2 data-section-id=\"1p79i0i\" data-start=\"889\" data-end=\"929\">Salaires \u2013 D\u00e9veloppement IT \/ Web<\/h2><div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\"><div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\"><table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"931\" data-end=\"1358\"><thead data-start=\"931\" data-end=\"1001\"><tr data-start=\"931\" data-end=\"1001\"><th class=\"\" data-start=\"931\" data-end=\"940\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Niveau<\/th><th class=\"\" data-start=\"940\" data-end=\"953\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Exp\u00e9rience<\/th><th class=\"\" data-start=\"953\" data-end=\"977\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Salaire mensuel (EURO)<\/th><th class=\"\" data-start=\"977\" data-end=\"1001\" data-col-size=\"md\">Missions principales<\/th><\/tr><\/thead><tbody data-start=\"1071\" data-end=\"1358\"><tr data-start=\"1071\" data-end=\"1156\"><td data-start=\"1071\" data-end=\"1092\" data-col-size=\"sm\">D\u00e9veloppeur junior<\/td><td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1092\" data-end=\"1102\">0\u20132 ans<\/td><td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1102\" data-end=\"1118\">500 \u2013 800 EURO<\/td><td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1118\" data-end=\"1156\">D\u00e9veloppement de base, maintenance<\/td><\/tr><tr data-start=\"1157\" data-end=\"1253\"><td data-start=\"1157\" data-end=\"1180\" data-col-size=\"sm\">D\u00e9veloppeur confirm\u00e9<\/td><td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1180\" data-end=\"1190\">2\u20135 ans<\/td><td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1190\" data-end=\"1208\">800 \u2013 1 300 EURO<\/td><td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1208\" data-end=\"1253\">D\u00e9veloppement full-stack, projets clients<\/td><\/tr><tr data-start=\"1254\" data-end=\"1358\"><td data-start=\"1254\" data-end=\"1272\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Senior \/ Expert<\/td><td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1272\" data-end=\"1281\">5+ ans<\/td><td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1281\" data-end=\"1301\">1 300 \u2013 2 600 EURO<\/td><td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1301\" data-end=\"1358\">Architecture, projets complexes, encadrement d\u2019\u00e9quipe<\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><\/div><\/div><\/div>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-029df9a elementor-cta--layout-image-left elementor-cta--tablet-layout-image-above elementor-cta--mobile-layout-image-above elementor-cta--skin-classic elementor-animated-content elementor-bg-transform elementor-bg-transform-zoom-in elementor-widget elementor-widget-call-to-action\" data-id=\"029df9a\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"call-to-action.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-cta\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-cta__bg-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-cta__bg elementor-bg\" style=\"background-image: url(https:\/\/www.breedj.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/02\/Recrutez-des-stagiaires-travaillant-a-distance-copy-1024x541.webp);\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Recrutez-des-stagiaires-travaillant-a-distance-copy.webp\"><\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-cta__bg-overlay\"><\/div>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-cta__content\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-cta__title elementor-cta__content-item elementor-content-item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tBreedj connecte les talents \u00e0 l\u2019\u00e9chelle mondiale\t\t\t\t\t<\/h2>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-cta__description elementor-cta__content-item elementor-content-item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tBreedj est la plateforme technologique qui structure, digitalise et simplifie l\u2019ensemble du processus de collaboration avec une communaut\u00e9 de talents distribu\u00e9e. De l\u2019identification des opportunit\u00e9s au suivi des performances, en passant par la gestion compl\u00e8te de la conformit\u00e9, Breedj offre un cadre transparent et s\u00e9curis\u00e9 pour travailler avec des talents externes.<\/br><\/br>\n\nPr\u00e9sente dans neuf pays et soutenant une communaut\u00e9 de professionnels qualifi\u00e9s, Breedj permet aux entreprises d\u2019acc\u00e9der \u00e0 des talents via des dispositifs externalis\u00e9s, \u00e0 distance, en t\u00e9l\u00e9travail ou en portage salarial, sans n\u00e9cessit\u00e9 de cr\u00e9er une entit\u00e9 locale.\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-cta__button-wrapper elementor-cta__content-item elementor-content-item \">\n\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"elementor-cta__button elementor-button elementor-size-\" href=\"https:\/\/www.breedj.com\/fr\/rejoignez-nous\/\" target=\"_blank\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tDevenez membre Breedj\t\t\t\t\t<\/a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-79b3bcb elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"79b3bcb\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2 data-section-id=\"1ybuxio\" data-start=\"3410\" data-end=\"3465\">Niveaux de r\u00e9mun\u00e9ration au Kenya : \u00e0 quoi s\u2019attendre<\/h2><p data-start=\"3467\" data-end=\"3532\">Les salaires au Kenya varient en fonction de plusieurs crit\u00e8res :<\/p><ul data-start=\"3534\" data-end=\"3703\"><li data-section-id=\"g65x6v\" data-start=\"3534\" data-end=\"3557\"><p data-start=\"3536\" data-end=\"3557\">Niveau d\u2019exp\u00e9rience<\/p><\/li><li data-section-id=\"1ma5crl\" data-start=\"3558\" data-end=\"3581\"><p data-start=\"3560\" data-end=\"3581\">Domaine d\u2019expertise<\/p><\/li><li data-section-id=\"vtxchz\" data-start=\"3582\" data-end=\"3654\"><p data-start=\"3584\" data-end=\"3654\">Type de collaboration (freelance, portage salarial, externalisation)<\/p><\/li><li data-section-id=\"973cyc\" data-start=\"3655\" data-end=\"3703\"><p data-start=\"3657\" data-end=\"3703\">Exposition \u00e0 des entreprises internationales<\/p><\/li><\/ul><h3 data-section-id=\"191tdxj\" data-start=\"3705\" data-end=\"3728\">Tendances g\u00e9n\u00e9rales<\/h3><ul data-start=\"3730\" data-end=\"3944\"><li data-section-id=\"us374u\" data-start=\"3730\" data-end=\"3778\"><p data-start=\"3732\" data-end=\"3778\">Les profils juniors restent tr\u00e8s accessibles<\/p><\/li><li data-section-id=\"1m3zytk\" data-start=\"3779\" data-end=\"3851\"><p data-start=\"3781\" data-end=\"3851\">Les profils interm\u00e9diaires offrent un excellent rapport qualit\u00e9\/prix<\/p><\/li><li data-section-id=\"1sj2cap\" data-start=\"3852\" data-end=\"3944\"><p data-start=\"3854\" data-end=\"3944\">Les profils seniors, notamment en IT, peuvent se rapprocher des standards internationaux<\/p><\/li><\/ul><h3 data-section-id=\"1w7lfdm\" data-start=\"3946\" data-end=\"3978\">\u00c9l\u00e9ments \u00e0 prendre en compte<\/h3><ul data-start=\"3980\" data-end=\"4146\"><li data-section-id=\"1wv1vd8\" data-start=\"3980\" data-end=\"4029\"><p data-start=\"3982\" data-end=\"4029\">Les avantages locaux (assurance, cotisations)<\/p><\/li><li data-section-id=\"1ovjzki\" data-start=\"4030\" data-end=\"4085\"><p data-start=\"4032\" data-end=\"4085\">Les \u00e9carts entre march\u00e9 local et travail \u00e0 distance<\/p><\/li><li data-section-id=\"zvpa6h\" data-start=\"4086\" data-end=\"4146\"><p data-start=\"4088\" data-end=\"4146\">La concurrence internationale pour certains profils tech<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p data-start=\"4148\" data-end=\"4339\">\ud83d\udc49 Les niveaux de r\u00e9mun\u00e9ration pratiqu\u00e9s restent globalement comp\u00e9titifs, avec des \u00e9conomies significatives par rapport aux march\u00e9s occidentaux, tout en garantissant un bon niveau de qualit\u00e9.<\/p><div class=\"video-wrapper\"><iframe title=\"YouTube video player\" src=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/embed\/3xdJyVIilxE?si=2JZrZQ2-R05ulwuL\" width=\"560\" height=\"315\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"><\/iframe><\/div><h2 data-section-id=\"111z7u3\" data-start=\"4346\" data-end=\"4405\">D\u00e9fis courants et solutions pour collaborer efficacement<\/h2><p data-start=\"4407\" data-end=\"4471\">Collaborer avec des talents \u00e0 distance implique certains d\u00e9fis :<\/p><h3 data-section-id=\"1e9321a\" data-start=\"4473\" data-end=\"4499\">Conformit\u00e9 juridique<\/h3><p data-start=\"4500\" data-end=\"4573\">Chaque pays dispose de ses propres r\u00e8gles en mati\u00e8re de droit du travail.<\/p><h3 data-section-id=\"y1e5cq\" data-start=\"4575\" data-end=\"4599\">Gestion de la paie<\/h3><p data-start=\"4600\" data-end=\"4664\">Le paiement des salaires doit respecter les obligations locales.<\/p><h3 data-section-id=\"ypz1fb\" data-start=\"4666\" data-end=\"4694\">Gestion administrative<\/h3><p data-start=\"4695\" data-end=\"4769\">Contrats, d\u00e9clarations sociales, fiscalit\u00e9\u2026 autant d\u2019\u00e9l\u00e9ments \u00e0 ma\u00eetriser.<\/p><h3 data-section-id=\"1wwv8t7\" data-start=\"4771\" data-end=\"4802\">Structuration des \u00e9quipes<\/h3><p data-start=\"4803\" data-end=\"4888\">Mettre en place des processus efficaces \u00e0 distance n\u00e9cessite une organisation claire.<\/p><div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\"><h2 data-section-id=\"17ctn3n\" data-start=\"1365\" data-end=\"1407\">Salaires \u2013 Marketing digital &amp; data<\/h2><div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\"><div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-