 data-end=\"5241\">Breedj permet d\u2019employer des talents sans cr\u00e9er d\u2019entit\u00e9 locale, en assurant la conformit\u00e9 juridique et sociale.<\/p><h3 data-section-id=\"y1e5cq\" data-start=\"5243\" data-end=\"5267\">Gestion de la paie<\/h3><p data-start=\"5268\" data-end=\"5353\">Les salaires sont g\u00e9r\u00e9s de mani\u00e8re s\u00e9curis\u00e9e et conforme aux r\u00e9glementations locales.<\/p><h3 data-section-id=\"rkel11\" data-start=\"5355\" data-end=\"5377\">Portage salarial<\/h3><p data-start=\"5378\" data-end=\"5464\">Une solution flexible pour collaborer avec des talents sans complexit\u00e9 administrative.<\/p><h3 data-section-id=\"16v6ksj\" data-start=\"5466\" data-end=\"5509\">Mise en place d\u2019\u00e9quipes externalis\u00e9es<\/h3><p data-start=\"5510\" data-end=\"5602\">Breedj accompagne la structuration d\u2019\u00e9quipes compl\u00e8tes adapt\u00e9es aux besoins des entreprises.<\/p><p data-start=\"5604\" data-end=\"5734\">\ud83d\udc49 <a href=\"https:\/\/www.breedj.com\/fr\/portage-salarial-international\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Breedj est bien une solution de type employer of record (EOR)<\/a>, facilitant le travail \u00e0 distance de mani\u00e8re l\u00e9gale et s\u00e9curis\u00e9e.<\/p><h2 data-section-id=\"a1db7e\" data-start=\"1807\" data-end=\"1858\">Facteurs qui influencent le salaire au Kenya<\/h2><div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\"><div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\"><table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1860\" data-end=\"2250\"><thead data-start=\"1860\" data-end=\"1880\"><tr data-start=\"1860\" data-end=\"1880\"><th class=\"\" data-start=\"1860\" data-end=\"1870\" data-col-size=\"md\">Facteur<\/th><th class=\"\" data-start=\"1870\" data-end=\"1880\" data-col-size=\"md\">Impact<\/th><\/tr><\/thead><tbody data-start=\"1902\" data-end=\"2250\"><tr data-start=\"1902\" data-end=\"1978\"><td data-start=\"1902\" data-end=\"1926\" data-col-size=\"md\">Ma\u00eetrise de l\u2019anglais<\/td><td data-start=\"1926\" data-end=\"1978\" data-col-size=\"md\">Communication fluide avec clients internationaux<\/td><\/tr><tr data-start=\"1979\" data-end=\"2063\"><td data-start=\"1979\" data-end=\"2024\" data-col-size=\"md\">Comp\u00e9tences techniques (IT, data, digital)<\/td><td data-start=\"2024\" data-end=\"2063\" data-col-size=\"md\">Augmentation de la valeur du profil<\/td><\/tr><tr data-start=\"2064\" data-end=\"2122\"><td data-start=\"2064\" data-end=\"2104\" data-col-size=\"md\">Exp\u00e9rience sur comptes internationaux<\/td><td data-start=\"2104\" data-end=\"2122\" data-col-size=\"md\">Prime possible<\/td><\/tr><tr data-start=\"2123\" data-end=\"2174\"><td data-start=\"2123\" data-end=\"2147\" data-col-size=\"md\">Bilinguisme (FR \/ EN)<\/td><td data-start=\"2147\" data-end=\"2174\" data-col-size=\"md\">Salaire plus comp\u00e9titif<\/td><\/tr><tr data-start=\"2175\" data-end=\"2250\"><td data-start=\"2175\" data-end=\"2220\" data-col-size=\"md\">Horaires d\u00e9cal\u00e9s ou projets internationaux<\/td><td data-start=\"2220\" data-end=\"2250\" data-col-size=\"md\">R\u00e9mun\u00e9ration additionnelle<\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><\/div><\/div><h2 data-section-id=\"16qh3k1\" data-start=\"5741\" data-end=\"5801\">Une pr\u00e9sence multi-pays pour accompagner votre croissance<\/h2><p data-start=\"5803\" data-end=\"5865\">Breedj op\u00e8re aujourd\u2019hui dans plusieurs march\u00e9s strat\u00e9giques :<\/p><ul data-start=\"5867\" data-end=\"5979\"><li data-section-id=\"1wkkru4\" data-start=\"5867\" data-end=\"5878\"><p data-start=\"5869\" data-end=\"5878\">Maurice<\/p><\/li><li data-section-id=\"1009gsk\" data-start=\"5879\" data-end=\"5893\"><p data-start=\"5881\" data-end=\"5893\">Madagascar<\/p><\/li><li data-section-id=\"1g4fjhs\" data-start=\"5894\" data-end=\"5903\"><p data-start=\"5896\" data-end=\"5903\">Kenya<\/p><\/li><li data-section-id=\"1nthgbr\" data-start=\"5904\" data-end=\"5914\"><p data-start=\"5906\" data-end=\"5914\">Rwanda<\/p><\/li><li data-section-id=\"x9lcu2\" data-start=\"5915\" data-end=\"5924\"><p data-start=\"5917\" data-end=\"5924\">Maroc<\/p><\/li><li data-section-id=\"1lxsv4h\" data-start=\"5925\" data-end=\"5936\"><p data-start=\"5927\" data-end=\"5936\">Tunisie<\/p><\/li><li data-section-id=\"15rb7q5\" data-start=\"5937\" data-end=\"5954\"><p data-start=\"5939\" data-end=\"5954\">C\u00f4te d\u2019Ivoire<\/p><\/li><li data-section-id=\"10tp0tb\" data-start=\"5955\" data-end=\"5966\"><p data-start=\"5957\" data-end=\"5966\">S\u00e9n\u00e9gal<\/p><\/li><li data-section-id=\"18js2n8\" data-start=\"5967\" data-end=\"5979\"><p data-start=\"5969\" data-end=\"5979\">Cameroun<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p data-start=\"5981\" data-end=\"6122\">Cette pr\u00e9sence permet aux entreprises d\u2019acc\u00e9der \u00e0 une large diversit\u00e9 de profils et de comp\u00e9tences, tout en b\u00e9n\u00e9ficiant d\u2019un cadre harmonis\u00e9.<\/p><h2 data-section-id=\"19egxrf\" data-start=\"6129\" data-end=\"6176\">Tendances et perspectives du march\u00e9 au Kenya<\/h2><p data-start=\"6178\" data-end=\"6238\">Le march\u00e9 du travail au Kenya continue d\u2019\u00e9voluer rapidement.<\/p><h3 data-section-id=\"x2pkwj\" data-start=\"6240\" data-end=\"6267\">Croissance du digital<\/h3><p data-start=\"6268\" data-end=\"6333\">Les m\u00e9tiers li\u00e9s \u00e0 la tech et au num\u00e9rique sont en forte demande.<\/p><h3 data-section-id=\"1m4r2j\" data-start=\"6335\" data-end=\"6376\">D\u00e9veloppement du travail \u00e0 distance<\/h3><p data-start=\"6377\" data-end=\"6460\">De plus en plus de professionnels travaillent avec des entreprises internationales.<\/p><h3 data-section-id=\"1chgunf\" data-start=\"6462\" data-end=\"6489\">Mont\u00e9e en comp\u00e9tences<\/h3><p data-start=\"6490\" data-end=\"6552\">Les talents investissent davantage dans la formation continue.<\/p><h3 data-section-id=\"ve6bsb\" data-start=\"6554\" data-end=\"6579\">Attractivit\u00e9 accrue<\/h3><p data-start=\"6580\" data-end=\"6659\">Le Kenya devient une destination incontournable <a href=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/watch?v=D06bMWbjbgk\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">pour les \u00e9quipes externalis\u00e9es<\/a>.<\/p><p data-start=\"6681\" data-end=\"6978\">Le Kenya repr\u00e9sente une opportunit\u00e9 strat\u00e9gique pour les entreprises souhaitant structurer des \u00e9quipes \u00e0 distance performantes et comp\u00e9titives. Avec un vivier de talents qualifi\u00e9s, une forte culture digitale et des co\u00fbts ma\u00eetris\u00e9s, le pays offre un excellent \u00e9quilibre entre qualit\u00e9 et efficacit\u00e9.<\/p><p data-start=\"6980\" data-end=\"7316\">Gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 son approche \u00e9thique et conforme, Breedj permet de simplifier la collaboration avec ces talents, en prenant en charge les aspects juridiques, administratifs et op\u00e9rationnels. En facilitant l\u2019acc\u00e8s \u00e0 l\u2019emploi et en soutenant le d\u00e9veloppement des comp\u00e9tences, la plateforme contribue \u00e9galement \u00e0 une croissance \u00e9conomique durable.<\/p><div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\"><h2 data-section-id=\"1k5ok6t\" data-start=\"2257\" data-end=\"2313\">Avantages de travailler avec des talents au Kenya<\/h2><div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\"><div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\"><table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2315\" data-end=\"2705\"><thead data-start=\"2315\" data-end=\"2336\"><tr data-start=\"2315\" data-end=\"2336\"><th class=\"\" data-start=\"2315\" data-end=\"2326\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Avantage<\/th><th class=\"\" data-start=\"2326\" data-end=\"2336\" data-col-size=\"md\">D\u00e9tail<\/th><\/tr><\/thead><tbody data-start=\"2359\" data-end=\"2705\"><tr data-start=\"2359\" data-end=\"2431\"><td data-start=\"2359\" data-end=\"2384\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Comp\u00e9tences qualifi\u00e9es<\/td><td data-start=\"2384\" data-end=\"2431\" data-col-size=\"md\">Profil